<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were called to open on Thursday by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX August gold - up $0.50 to $1.00 an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX Sept silver - unchanged to up 1.0 cent an ounce</p>
<p>NYMEX Oct platinum - unchanged to down $1.00 an ounce</p>
<p>NYMEX Sept palladium - unchanged to down $1.00 an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX Sept copper - unchanged to up 0.30 cent a pound</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
